  rules:
  - id: 0
    title: Wrong side of the road
    citation: Law 014/2026, Art. 4
    explanation: Vehicles drive on the right-hand side of the road.
    timePenalty: 20
    fineFrw: 0
    demeritPoints: 2
    endsRun: 0
    fromOrder: 0
  - id: 1
    title: Ignoring an officer
    citation: Law 014/2026, Art. 6(3)
    explanation: An officer's instructions take priority over road signs and signals.
    timePenalty: 30
    fineFrw: 0
    demeritPoints: 0
    endsRun: 0
    fromOrder: 0
  - id: 2
    title: Refusing to stop
    citation: Law 014/2026, Art. 39
    explanation: 'Refusing to stop when signalled by an officer is an offence: a
      fine of FRW 400,000 to 700,000 and 3 to 6 months'' imprisonment.'
    timePenalty: 0
    fineFrw: 400000
    demeritPoints: 0
    endsRun: 1
    fromOrder: 1
  - id: 3
    title: Driving without a licence
    citation: Law 014/2026, Art. 40 and 12(1)(a)
    explanation: Driving without a licence is an offence (fine of FRW 100,000 to
      200,000 and/or 15 to 30 days), and the vehicle is immobilised.
    timePenalty: 120
    fineFrw: 100000
    demeritPoints: 0
    endsRun: 1
    fromOrder: 1
  - id: 4
    title: Ran a red signal
    citation: Law 014/2026, Art. 5(1)(g); details in the Minister's Order
    explanation: Road traffic signs and signals must be obeyed. The fine and points
      are set by the Minister's Order (not yet supplied).
    timePenalty: 30
    fineFrw: 0
    demeritPoints: 3
    endsRun: 0
    fromOrder: 0
  - id: 9
    title: Did not stop at a STOP sign
    citation: Law 014/2026, Art. 5(1)(g); details in the Minister's Order
    explanation: At a STOP sign the vehicle must come to a complete stop at the line,
      then go only when the way is clear. The fine and points are set by the Minister's
      Order (not yet supplied).
    timePenalty: 20
    fineFrw: 0
    demeritPoints: 2
    endsRun: 0
    fromOrder: 0
  - id: 5
    title: Speeding
    citation: Law 014/2026, Art. 5; limits in the Minister's Order
    explanation: Speed limits are set by the Minister's Order (not yet supplied);
      the game uses a placeholder town limit.
    timePenalty: 25
    fineFrw: 0
    demeritPoints: 2
    endsRun: 0
    fromOrder: 0
  - id: 7
    title: No seatbelt
    citation: Minister's Order (not yet supplied)
    explanation: Placeholder rule until the Order's text is added.
    timePenalty: 15
    fineFrw: 0
    demeritPoints: 1
    endsRun: 0
    fromOrder: 0
  - id: 6
    title: No helmet on a moto
    citation: Minister's Order (not yet supplied)
    explanation: Placeholder rule until the Order's text is added.
    timePenalty: 15
    fineFrw: 0
    demeritPoints: 0
    endsRun: 0
    fromOrder: 0
  - id: 8
    title: Over the alcohol limit
    citation: Law 014/2026, Art. 9
    explanation: The maximum blood alcohol level for a driver is 0.80 grams per litre
      of blood.
    timePenalty: 0
    fineFrw: 0
    demeritPoints: 0
    endsRun: 1
    fromOrder: 1
  cards:
  - id: card_drive_right
    theme: road
    title: Drive on the right
    textEn: In Rwanda the driving side is the right-hand side of the road.
    textRw: 
    textFr: 
    sources:
    - "Law n\xB0 014/2026 of 06/03/2026 governing road traffic, Art. 4 (Official
      Gazette, Special of 10/03/2026)"
    reviewStatus: draft
  - id: card_officer
    theme: road
    title: Officers come first
    textEn: When an officer is directing traffic, their instructions take priority
      over road signs and signals.
    textRw: 
    textFr: 
    sources:
    - "Law n\xB0 014/2026, Art. 6(3)"
    reviewStatus: draft
  - id: card_refuse_stop
    theme: road
    title: Always stop when signalled
    textEn: 'Refusing to stop when an officer signals you is an offence: a fine of
      FRW 400,000 to 700,000 and 3 to 6 months'' imprisonment.'
    textRw: 
    textFr: 
    sources:
    - "Law n\xB0 014/2026, Art. 39"
    reviewStatus: draft
  - id: card_greetings
    theme: language
    title: Greetings for a visit
    textEn: 'Mwaramutse: good morning. Muraho: hello. Amakuru?: how are you? Murakoze:
      thank you. Icyayi: tea.'
    textRw: "Mwaramutse \xB7 Muraho \xB7 Amakuru? \xB7 Murakoze \xB7 Icyayi"
    textFr: 
    sources:
    - 'TODO: native-speaker review'
    reviewStatus: draft
  - id: card_market
    theme: place
    title: Kimironko Market
    textEn: Kimironko Market sits right next to Kimironko taxi park, so buses and
      motos arrive at its door.
    textRw: 
    textFr: 
    sources:
    - "OpenStreetMap: way 106506354 (market) and way 143205338 (taxi park), \xA9
      OpenStreetMap contributors"
    reviewStatus: draft
  - id: card_study
    theme: study
    title: Read in short blocks
    textEn: Reading in short, focused blocks with notes at the end of each one is
      easier to keep up during summative week.
    textRw: 
    textFr: 
    sources:
    - 'TODO: add a study-skills source'
    reviewStatus: draft
  - id: card_cell
    theme: place
    title: Kibagabaga is a cell
    textEn: Kibagabaga is a cell within Kimironko sector, Gasabo District.
    textRw: 
    textFr: 
    sources:
    - 'OpenStreetMap: ''Kibagabaga Cell Office'', way 206839949'
    - 'TODO: verify against Gasabo District''s list'
    reviewStatus: draft
  news:
  - 'Kimironko: traders expect a busy market day. Allow extra time around the taxi
